{
  "id": "conveyors___capacities",
  "title": "Conveyors - Capacities",
  "description": "Calculate conveyor belt capacity based on belt speed, width, material density, and cross-sectional area. Uses the formula Q = ρ A v where Q is conveyor capacity, ρ is material density, A is cross-sectional area, and v is belt velocity.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Conveyors - Capacities\n\nConveyor capacity is determined by the belt speed, width and the angle of the belt - and can be expressed as:\n\n**Q = ρ A v**\n\nWhere:\n- **Q** = conveyor capacity (kg/s, lb/s)\n- **ρ** = density of transported material (kg/m³, lb/ft³)\n- **A** = cross-sectional area of the bulk solid on the belt (m², ft²)\n- **v** = conveyor belt velocity (m/s, ft/s)\n\nThe cross-sectional area of the bulk solid on the belt can be calculated as:\n\n**A = U b²**\n\nWhere:\n- **U** = non-dimensional cross-sectional area shape factor\n- **b** = contact perimeter between bulk material and belt (m, ft)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Material Density (ρ)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1500,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "shape_factor",
          "label": "Shape Factor (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.4,
          "unit": "dimensionless"
        },
        {
          "id": "contact_perimeter",
          "label": "Contact Perimeter (b)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.5,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "belt_velocity",
          "label": "Belt Velocity (v)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "m/s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "cross_section_area",
          "label": "Cross-sectional Area (A)",
          "formula": "inputs.shape_factor * inputs.contact_perimeter * inputs.contact_perimeter",
          "unit": "m²",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "capacity_kg_s",
          "label": "Conveyor Capacity",
          "formula": "inputs.density * (inputs.shape_factor * inputs.contact_perimeter * inputs.contact_perimeter) * inputs.belt_velocity",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "capacity_kg_h",
          "label": "Conveyor Capacity",
          "formula": "inputs.density * (inputs.shape_factor * inputs.contact_perimeter * inputs.contact_perimeter) * inputs.belt_velocity * 3600",
          "unit": "kg/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "capacity_m3_h",
          "label": "Volume Capacity",
          "formula": "(inputs.shape_factor * inputs.contact_perimeter * inputs.contact_perimeter) * inputs.belt_velocity * 3600",
          "unit": "m³/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
